# Regression: two numerically merged midpoint realizations must not create an
# angle fact for the zero connector between their canonical midpoint aliases.
mode generate
option trials 1
option show_easy 1
point A 1000000 0
point B 1000001 0
point C 1000001.03 0
midpoint M A B
point D 1000000.5 1
line p M D
perp_bisector q A C
line base A C
